<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Modular Terrain Planner: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f6; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
li { margin: 0.1rem 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Modular Terrain Planner is MIT-licensed. It is built with these open-source crates. The build plan font,
Cantarell, is under the SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 (see OFL.txt next to this file).</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li>{{name}} ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
